  "description": "Welcome to 12 Decatur Street, Alkimos - a stylish and low-maintenance home perfectly suited to modern coastal living.<br/><br/>Positioned in the sought-after Shorehaven Estate, this beautifully presented 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home offers a smart, functional layout with everything you need for comfortable everyday living.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>3 spacious bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>2 modern bathrooms<br/>Contemporary kitchen with stone benchtops<br/>Stainless-steel appliances<br/>Open-plan living and dining<br/>Reverse-cycle air conditioning<br/>Secure double lock-up garage<br/>Low-maintenance lifestyle<br/><br/>VIEWING & APPLICATION INFORMATION<br/>• Does this property tick the boxes? Yes - Click the 'BOOK AN INSPECTION' button. If there isn't a time available, send through the enquiry so you can be contacted when one is booked. Please be aware, if there isn't a time available, there may have already been an inspection and applications pending.<br/>• The property MUST be viewed by yourself or someone on your behalf before you can apply<br/>• Applications will NOT be accepted prior to viewing<br/>• We use the 2Apply platform so you are welcome to prepare your profile - after the viewing, you will be sent the code to submit your application<br/>• Something else you need to know? Please EMAIL your enquiry as we are often on the road, in appointments or with clients and do not have the information at hand.",
